#
# Test vectors for initfs.abnf (ADR 0037, rule 2; ADR 0013, rule 6).
#
# Each vector is one line: "ok" or "err", "@" and the rule it tests, a tab,
# then the octets as \xHH escapes. The grammar can't express the image's
# lengths, offsets and alignment (its constraint comments say so), so these
# vectors test the header and the entry, whose layout it fixes. The image
# reader's own tests in crates/initfs cover the constraints.
#
# Directives for tools/ci/check-grammars.py:
# rule: header

